{"3026130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cathy And The Others", "steam_appid": 3026130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026130/extras/a48ac57af2cdb08f085434e9e340fad7.poster.avif?t=1725114249\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026130/extras/a48ac57af2cdb08f085434e9e340fad7.webm?t=1725114249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026130/extras/a48ac57af2cdb08f085434e9e340fad7.mp4?t=1725114249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Cathy And The Others</strong> is an emotional narrative game that puts you in the shoes of Cathy, a woman who wakes up in the bedroom of a strange house. Explore, search, but most importantly... <strong>escape </strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive narrative</strong>: Cathy And The Others offers a unique and experimental narrative experience. Discover Cathy's past to understand what is happening to her!<br></li><li><strong>Puzzle-based exploration</strong>: Find a way to unlock the next room in an escape room style.<br></li><li><strong>Interactive environment</strong>: Interact with various objects in the house to help you escape, read notes, and find secret combinations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Multiple endings</strong>: Make the best choice for yourself.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026130/extras/200363674589834b3bffc4c66e9f185e.poster.avif?t=1725114249\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026130/